title: Alcatel Switches: Memory Usage
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/alcatel
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the memory usage of Alcatel OmniSwitch switches in percent.

 On switches running AOS 7 or later, the check uses the latest memory value
 of the first module (healthModuleMemoryLatest). On switches running an
 older AOS release, it uses the latest memory value of the device
 (healthDeviceMemoryLatest).

 The check is {WARN} at 80% and {CRIT} at 90% memory usage. These levels can
 be configured with the rule "Memory utilization".

 The check uses the ALCATEL-IND1-HEALTH-MIB.

discovery:
 One service is created.
